{
    "title": "Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring",
    "description": "<b>Cast to TV</b> allows you to easily cast your phone screen to smart TV. With this app, you can <b>quickly cast your videos, photos, and music to the big screen</b> with just a few taps. Cast to TV supports the most popular streaming devices, letting you enjoy high-quality streaming of your favorite content in real time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Key Features\r\n- Cast movies, web video, photo slideshow, and more\r\n- Easy to control TV: pause, fast forward, adjust volume, subtitle\r\n- <b>Screen Mirroring</b>: Mirror your phone screen in real time to the bigger screen\r\n- Support the most popular streaming devices\r\n- <b>Remote control for TV</b>\r\n- Built-in browser for web video cast\r\n- Playlists: play media in shuffle, loop or repeat mode.\r\n- Play History\r\n- HD Video Player: enjoy a high quality watching experience\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Supported Devices:\r\n- Smart TVs: Sony, Samsung, LG TV, etc.\r\n- Apple TV\r\n- Fire TV, Xbox \r\n- Web Browser, PC, PS4\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfa <b>Cast to TV</b>\r\nWhether you want to watch your favorite TV shows, enjoy a live stream, or just show off your holiday photos, Cast to TV makes it easy. Just select your favorite movie and watch it in full HD.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Screen Mirroring</b>\r\nMirror your mobile device's screen on your TV, and show off photos and videos to your friends and family. It allows you to play your favorite games on the big screen, giving you a much more realistic and immersive experience.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 <b>Easy to Control</b>\r\nYou can control basic video functions such as play, pause, adjust volume, switch between channels, and even enter text with the keyboard to search for movies. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc5\ufe0f <b>Web Browser</b>\r\nCast to TV offers a built-in web browser that allows you to cast web videos to TV. It also offers a range of other features, including bookmark, playback history, and different resolutions. And you can block pop-ups and ads to keep unwanted advertisements from distracting you.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing our Cast to TV app! If you have any suggestions or issues, please don't hesitate to contact us at cast.videostudio.feedback@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Cast to TV</b> allows you to easily cast your phone screen to smart TV. With this app, you can <b>quickly cast your videos, photos, and music to the big screen</b> with just a few taps. Cast to TV supports the most popular streaming devices, letting you enjoy high-quality streaming of your favorite content in real time.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features<br>- Cast movies, web video, photo slideshow, and more<br>- Easy to control TV: pause, fast forward, adjust volume, subtitle<br>- <b>Screen Mirroring</b>: Mirror your phone screen in real time to the bigger screen<br>- Support the most popular streaming devices<br>- <b>Remote control for TV</b><br>- Built-in browser for web video cast<br>- Playlists: play media in shuffle, loop or repeat mode.<br>- Play History<br>- HD Video Player: enjoy a high quality watching experience<br><br><br>\ud83d\udca1 Supported Devices:<br>- Smart TVs: Sony, Samsung, LG TV, etc.<br>- Apple TV<br>- Fire TV, Xbox <br>- Web Browser, PC, PS4<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcfa <b>Cast to TV</b><br>Whether you want to watch your favorite TV shows, enjoy a live stream, or just show off your holiday photos, Cast to TV makes it easy. Just select your favorite movie and watch it in full HD.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Screen Mirroring</b><br>Mirror your mobile device&#39;s screen on your TV, and show off photos and videos to your friends and family. It allows you to play your favorite games on the big screen, giving you a much more realistic and immersive experience.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 <b>Easy to Control</b><br>You can control basic video functions such as play, pause, adjust volume, switch between channels, and even enter text with the keyboard to search for movies. <br><br>\ud83c\udfc5\ufe0f <b>Web Browser</b><br>Cast to TV offers a built-in web browser that allows you to cast web videos to TV. It also offers a range of other features, including bookmark, playback history, and different resolutions. And you can block pop-ups and ads to keep unwanted advertisements from distracting you.<br><br><br>Thank you for choosing our Cast to TV app! If you have any suggestions or issues, please don&#39;t hesitate to contact us at cast.videostudio.feedback@gmail.com.",
